{% extends 'base.html.twig' %}

{% block title %}AC12.03 – Connecting ToIP systems{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
    <div class="container">

        <h1>AC12.03 – Connecting ToIP systems</h1>

        <p>
            <strong>Objective :</strong>
            Set up and configure a Voice over IP (VoIP) infrastructure
            using a FreePBX IPBX and SIP softphones.
        </p>

        <hr>

        <h2>Reflective analysis</h2>

        <p>
            During the various VoIP labs carried out using FreePBX and the
            3CX Phone softphone, I learned how to connect and configure several
            ToIP systems within a virtual network environment.
        </p>

        <p>
            I configured SIP endpoints, created telephone extensions,
            set up SIP trunks, and configured outbound routes in order
            to enable communication between multiple IPBX systems.
            These tasks helped me understand how VoIP communications work
            and how network devices exchange data in a telephony infrastructure.
        </p>

        <p>
            I also used several softphones such as 3CX Phone,
            MicroSIP, Zoiper, and Ekiga to test internal and inter-site
            communications. I learned how to configure SIP parameters such as
            username, password, server IP address, and transport protocols.
        </p>

        <p>
            Using Wireshark and tshark, I analyzed SIP and RTP traffic
            to verify call functionality and identify potential communication issues.
            I also understood the role of Interactive Voice Response (IVR) systems,
            call groups, and call forwarding within a ToIP infrastructure.
        </p>

        <p>
            This activity allowed me to develop practical skills in
            VoIP system administration and better understand the integration
            of communication services within a corporate network.
        </p>

        <h2>Supporting documents</h2>

        <ul>
            <li>Configuration of SIP extensions on FreePBX.</li>
            <li>Call screenshots using 3CX Phone and Zoiper.</li>
            <li>Configuration of SIP trunks between two IPBX systems.</li>
            <li>Analysis of SIP and RTP traffic using Wireshark.</li>
            <li>Setup of outbound routes and dial plans.</li>
            <li>Configuration of an Interactive Voice Response (IVR) system.</li>
            <li>tshark captures performed on the Linux IPBX server.</li>
        </ul>

